--- !u!114 &5360365568936612268
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5911275707261708388}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Thanks to you the gate to hell opened in this desolate land. You did it.
    Catan did it.

    As you may know the devil lies within everybody, sometimes
    deep inside, often showing in the worst moment the civilisation faces.

    Your
    beliefs got you where you are now. But look at yourself, all the people you met
    along the way have to face a rude reality, their friend betrayed them literally
    opening the gate of hell to late the demon rampage their lives.

    There''s
    nothing to be ashamed of in your viewpoint, it was your mission, your will of
    life.

    All you lived for is now accomplished, your existence is complete.


    Well
    done.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
