  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You died. not in a peaceful way but in a suffering way.

    All your
    beliefs will surely be accomplished by someone else later but for now, this land
    can rest a little.

    You might think you could have done better but your death
    means a lot. It means people will live, it might be out of sight for you but
    the devil within everyone isn''t necessarily all there is about a person.

    Now
    that you escaped the palm of the devil you may rest yourself.

    Live well
    from now little lamb.


    Well done.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
